  "description": "Statistics for the Ranvier reactive graph: continuous and discrete distributions, descriptive statistics, confidence intervals, hypothesis tests, a sequential test with its confidence sequence, multiple-testing adjustments, regression, correlation, curve fitting, the bootstrap and kernel density estimation.",
